  "name": "alcoholhealthwarninglabel_brennan_2022_emotional_arousal_followup",
  "description": "Follow-up positive and negative emotion ratings toward alcohol warning label images. Item response data in the Item Response Warehouse (IRW), a harmonised collection of item-level response data for psychometric research. 6,522 responses from 1,087 respondents to 6 items. Classified as: Adult (18+); Targeted/specific; Opinion/attitude; Survey/questionnaire; Likert Scale/selected response; eng; Positive Emotional Arousal to Alcohol Warning Labels.",
  "url": "https://itemresponsewarehouse.org/tables/alcoholhealthwarninglabel_brennan_2022_emotional_arousal_followup/",
  "version": "332.0.0",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-03",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0",
  "citation": "Brennan, Emily. Alcohol Health Warning Study. Ann Arbor, MI: Inter-university Consortium for Political and Social Research [distributor], 2022-10-12. https://doi.org/10.3886/E175721V1",
  "citeAs": "Brennan, Emily. Alcohol Health Warning Study. Ann Arbor, MI: Inter-university Consortium for Political and Social Research [distributor], 2022-10-12. https://doi.org/10.3886/E175721V1",
